    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 26/09/2024 the use of the ground floor as a GP clinic, and the associated internal works necessary to convert the property into a health clinic, is lawful within the meaning of section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reasons:\r\n\r\nThe proposed works and use of the property would not constitute \"development\" as defined by Section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).\r\n"
